CCNA topic map
==============

Every CCNA 200-301 lab topic with the PTForge functions and examples that cover it.

    Exam area              Topic                           Functions                                           Example
    ---------------------  ------------------------------  --------------------------------------------------  ------------------------------------
    Network fundamentals   IPv4 addressing and subnetting  planSubnets, splitSubnet, hostRange, addressHosts   08-topology/vlsm-plan.js
                           IPv6 addressing                 setInterfaceIpv6, configurePcIpv6                   03-routing/ipv6-ospfv3.js
                           Cabling and interfaces          addLink, getPortInfo, setSpeedDuplex                01-basics/first-network.js
    Network access         VLANs and access ports          createVlans, setAccessPort, assignPorts             02-switching/vlans-and-trunks.js
                           Trunks and native VLAN          setTrunkPort, setDtpMode                            02-switching/vlans-and-trunks.js
                           Inter VLAN routing              routerOnAStick, addSvi, enableIpRouting             10-ccna-labs/router-on-a-stick.js
                           CDP and LLDP                    setCdp, setLldp, setPortCdp
                           EtherChannel                    createEtherChannel                                  02-switching/etherchannel.js
                           Rapid PVST+                     setStpMode, setStpRoot, enablePortfast, getStpInfo  02-switching/stp-root.js
                           Wireless                        configureWireless                                   06-wireless/home-wireless.js
    IP connectivity        Static and floating routes      addStaticRoute, addFloatingRoute, addDefaultRoute   03-routing/static-routing.js
                           Single area OSPFv2              configureOspf, setOspfInterface, getOspfInfo        03-routing/ospf-multi-area.js
                           First hop redundancy            configureHsrp, configureHsrpPair                    04-security/hsrp.js
    IP services            NAT and PAT                     configurePat, addStaticNat, configureNatPool        04-security/nat-pat.js
                           NTP                             setNtpServer
                           DHCP and relay                  addRouterDhcpPool, setDhcpRelay, addDhcpPool        05-services/router-dhcp-relay.js
                           DNS                             addDnsRecord, setNameServer                         05-services/server-dhcp-dns-web.js
                           SNMP and syslog                 setSnmpCommunity, setSyslogServer
                           SSH                             configureSsh                                        04-security/ssh-and-port-security.js
                           TFTP and FTP                    setTftpService, addFtpUser                          05-services/ftp-email.js
    Security fundamentals  Device passwords                basicSetup, setEnableSecret, setMinPasswordLength   01-basics/secure-baseline.js
                           ACLs                            createStandardAcl, createExtendedAcl, applyAcl      04-security/acl-web-only.js
                           Port security                   configurePortSecurity, getPortSecurityStatus        04-security/ssh-and-port-security.js
                           DHCP snooping and DAI           enableDhcpSnooping, enableArpInspection
                           AAA                             configureAaa
                           WPA2                            configureWireless                                   06-wireless/home-wireless.js
    Automation             Scripting a network             Everything above                                    10-ccna-labs/full-enterprise.js

See also the lab checklist: https://github.com/r4chan842/PTForge/blob/main/docs/ccna/lab-checklist.
